    checkpoints: [{ question: 'Why is SELECT followed by an unconditional UPDATE insufficient for claiming work?', answer: 'Two workers can both observe Queued. The runnable-state condition must be checked atomically by the update that claims the row.' }, { question: 'Does the existing digest upsert prove an email is delivered exactly once?', answer: 'No. It deduplicates a stored draft by student and week. External delivery needs its own protocol and evidence; several demo job types are simulated.' }],
